- Differential comparator `--self-test` — PASS; `--validate-manifest` — PASS, 37 scenarios.
- Fuzz smoke — PASS: 163 frame seeds, 11 message seeds, 2,784 bounded mutations, 245 frame decodes and 192 message decodes.
