- Release facade examples build and offline benchmark build/run — PASS.
- Benchmark observations are appended to `docs/compatibility/PHASE_18_OFFLINE_BENCHMARK_BASELINE.md`; they set no performance threshold.

## Remaining acceptance work

P18-V01's broad Java source/API/settings/input/error/control-flow and Rust
reverse-export reconciliation remains PARTIAL. Thirty live handoff scenarios
remain `PENDING_PHASE_19`. The prior Windows GNU Consumer cross-check passed at
revision `60238931`; native Windows runtime and current-revision remote Ubuntu
CI remain unverified. The MSVC retry remains blocked by missing local Windows
SDK headers. Phase 19 Broker/Docker evidence is outstanding.

The external Java checkout at RocketMQ 5.3.3 and its pre-existing untracked
`broker/src/test/java/org/apache/rocketmq/broker/aaaa.java` were left
untouched. This change uses pinned Java 5.5.1 source commit
`efa1be59d6fc747ad220f036c86030f05f0419f9` and pinned 5.5.1 Maven artifacts.
